## Article 1. Citizens' Appeals

```catala
declaration scope Article1AppealRight:
  input author content AppealAuthor
  input appealType content AppealType
  input addressee content AddresseeType
  input concernsOfficialDuties content YesNo
  input isMilitaryOrPolice content YesNo
  input isForeigner content YesNo
  input internationalTreatyException content YesNo
  output hasAppealRight content YesNo
  output appealMustBeAccepted content YesNo

scope Article1AppealRight:
  label citizen_right_exception default_citizen_right
  definition hasAppealRight under condition
    author.category = Citizen
    consequence equals Yes

  label military_exception default_citizen_right
  definition hasAppealRight under condition
    isMilitaryOrPolice = Yes and concernsOfficialDuties = Yes
    consequence equals No

  label foreigner_right_exception default_citizen_right
  definition hasAppealRight under condition
    isForeigner = Yes and internationalTreatyException = No
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_citizen_right
  definition hasAppealRight equals No

  label must_accept_exception default_must_accept
  definition appealMustBeAccepted under condition
    hasAppealRight = Yes
    consequence equals Yes

  label default_must_accept
  definition appealMustBeAccepted equals No
```
